    # We'll be strict: no completely empty lines in the middle; but tolerate leading/trailing empty lines by stripping.
    # However, stripping can change line counts; simplest is to treat whole input as token stream but enforce m shot lines.
    # We'll enforce per-line shot structure: after reading n, a list, m, expect m non-empty lines each with 2 tokens.
    # So we must preserve line boundaries.
