# - exact line/token structure: token-based parsing: n k s t, then n pairs (ci, vi), then k station positions; no extra tokens
# - numeric bounds: enforce known CF 729C bounds: 1<=n<=2e5, 0<=k<=2e5, 1<=s<=1e9, 1<=t<=2e9, 1<=ci,vi<=1e9, positions in (0,s)
# - array/string lengths: exactly n cars and exactly k station positions
# - graph constraints: none
